From e87981246ff03a443ce2d7b5a0869032313da43e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:24:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy 0048: the lead's pre-flight review of
 d75dfec (0046, 0047)

(2) 0046's PREP saving never took effect. Personality's 553dfdc made BUILDUP need no gold,
    so IsLateStrikePrepSaving equalled the PREP -> BUILDUP condition, true for a turn at
    most. Removed with its two uses in CvEconomicAI; BUILDUP does the saving.
(5) The danger path ("a defender first") now builds an obsolete defender class as its
    upgrade, through GetStrikeListTrainableOnLine like 0047's.
(6) The late-PREP combat hold leaked. Scouts counted as combat units, and once every item
    was held the city fell to the regular book and CP, which still trained combat units.
    One helper, CvPlayer::IsLateStrikeUnitHold (late strike, PREP, not at war with a
    major, net gold under +2), now applies on every path:
    - the strike list;
    - the regular book's unit steps;
    - CP's unit sanity check (SR_STRATEGY unless the city is in danger).
    Scouts (UNITAI_EXPLORE) are exempt. The strike state is checked first, since this runs
    for every unit in every city.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
